  "title": "Grilled Tequila-Lime Shrimp",
  "description": "In this recipe, shrimp are seasoned with a zesty tequila, lime garlic, cumin, and black pepper marinade then grilled on skewers for a tasty appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "kellenf"
  ],
